(7321420, 1142374, 19825, '<td valign="top">Superb job on the image and ribbon. Tenth ribbon in a row and fourth blue. An impressive streak.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> ...which can be difficult when you are alone at home: start the camera timer, run downstairs half-naked, tie your feet and hands, then crawl on the floor into the good position.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I think you should video record your shoots so we could really get a "behind the scenes look". Thanks for the descriptions.<br/></td>', 'Superb job on the image and ribbon. Tenth ribbon in a row and fourth blue. An impressive streak. Originally posted by gyaban: ...which can be difficult when you are alone at home: start the camera timer, run downstairs half-naked, tie your feet and hands, then crawl on the floor into the good position. I think you should video record your shoots so we could really get a "behind the scenes look". Thanks for the descriptions.', '2015-02-27 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
